# Every tracked file in this repository is text. Pinning the working tree to
# LF keeps it independent of each machine's core.autocrlf setting, so a
# checkout on Windows and a checkout on Linux hold identical bytes.
#
# No binaries are tracked: the vendored MathJax build under assets/ is all
# JavaScript and JSON, and reference PDFs are excluded by .gitignore.
* text=auto eol=lf
